								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >The world as you know it is over.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >The dreaded zombie apocalypse has arrived.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >You are ready to make your last stand and go down in a blaze of glory…</p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >PROBLEM IS, you’re too good at this asymmetric warfare thing, and this “last stand” is taking forever. At this point, this is not about survival — this is about <strong>FUN</strong>. Shoot them, burn them, blow them up, and, if all else fails, <strong>SHRED THE DEAD</strong> — with your very own heavy-duty industrial shredder, of course.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.poster.avif?t=1793273903" width=800 height=334 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.webm?t=1793273903" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/bac56c54920a65940bd7875603a1eb5f.mp4?t=1793273903" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>ZOMBIE BLENDER</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Get into a flow state of methodically decimating the unending deluge of zombies — or have your grunts do it for you! Or both!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.poster.avif?t=1793273903" width=800 height=334 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.webm?t=1793273903" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/d3b7c377003267e8f09ae25cb3c86703.mp4?t=1793273903" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>BRANCHING OUT</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >As you turn more and more zombies into mincemeat, explore the vast skill tree to optimize the killing!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.poster.avif?t=1793273903" width=800 height=450 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.webm?t=1793273903" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/7dbd1cc99bbc298cfdf517fb0146c5cd.mp4?t=1793273903" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>LOCK AND LOAD</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Kit your grunts out with the best toys you can get your hands on — after all, zombies are nice enough to deliver the loot right to your doorstep!</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.poster.avif?t=1793273903" width=800 height=334 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.webm?t=1793273903" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704520/extras/95ad50f628e6bf2afd4734cfd8c0f226.mp4?t=1793273903" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>EMBRACE THE YUCK</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Zombies are known to evolve, but evolution is boring and takes too long. Why not have your mad scientist speed it up a little? With predictably gross results, of course!</p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
